---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /bank-privacy/index.html
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Which banks sell your data? Bank Privacy Index {{ bankPrivacy.lastChecked.slice(0, 4) }} — Nezr Kaan"
  description: "Do banks sell your data? {{ bankPrivacy.total }} of the most-used banks in the UK, the US and Europe, scored out of 10 on selling and sharing data, breaches and tracking."
  ogImage: "{{ bankPrivacy.ogImage }}"
  ogDescription: "Your bank knows what you spend your money on. {{ bankPrivacy.total }} of the most-used banks in the UK, the US and Europe, scored out of 10 on how they treat that data."
ogTitle: "Which banks sell your data? The Bank Privacy Index"
ogImageAlt: "Bank Privacy Index: which banks sell your data? The most-used banks in the UK, the US and Europe, scored out of 10."
keywords: "which banks sell your data, banks that don't sell your data, do banks sell your data, bank privacy, best bank for privacy, bank data sharing, UK banks, US banks, European banks"
showFieldNotesNav: true
headerMark: "NK / Bank Privacy"
headerHomeHref: "/"
extraStyles:
  - /css/archive.css
